/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
/* Language                                                            */
/* Bahasa Indonesia is the primary language. The lookup key IS the      */
/* English sentence, so an untranslated string degrades to readable     */
/* English instead of a raw key, and there is no key registry to keep   */
/* in sync. `{n}`-style placeholders are filled by the second argument. */
/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
