  "Locked by {name} · {when}. Records in this week are read-only.":
    "Dikunci oleh {name} · {when}. Catatan minggu ini hanya-baca.",
  "This week is locked, so attendance and corrections here are read-only. A change now needs a post-lock correction request: HR files it against a single day with a reason, the system reopens only that day for one edit, then reseals it. Every step is written to the audit log. That controlled flow is not part of this prototype build.":
    "Minggu ini terkunci, sehingga absensi dan koreksi di sini hanya-baca. Perubahan sekarang memerlukan pengajuan koreksi pasca-kunci: HR mengajukannya untuk satu hari disertai alasan, sistem membuka hanya hari itu untuk satu kali perubahan, lalu menutupnya lagi. Setiap langkah dicatat di log audit. Alur terkendali ini belum termasuk dalam prototipe.",
